@startuml activity
' Activity diagram with swimlanes. Rules: chapter 16 §7.
!include _treklink-style.puml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
title act MF-01 Request and approve a rental contract

|Org Manager|
start
:Submit contract request;
|TrekLink Rental Platform|
:Record the request as REQUESTED;
|TrekLink Staff|
:Review the request;
if (Enough available units?) then ([yes])
  :Approve and reserve devices;
  |TrekLink Rental Platform|
  :Set the contract APPROVED;
  :Email the Org Manager;
else ([no])
  |TrekLink Staff|
  :Reject with a reason;
  |TrekLink Rental Platform|
  :Set the contract REJECTED;
endif
|Org Manager|
:Read the decision;
stop
@enduml
